{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日もたくさんの方が来てくれましたね (๑╹∀╹๑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生誕祭まで......（；＿；）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"せっちゃんと一緒にお祝いしていただきました❤"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーばい本当嬉しかったすぎた↷꒰ू´•௰ू• `꒱↷"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あんなにたくさんの人にハッピーバースデー歌ってもらったの初めてだよ...（ ;  ; ）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幸せ幸せ幸せでした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2013/10/13/7125712/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"せっちゃんもおめでとう( ´ ▽ ` )ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生誕祭でも言った通り、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私の19歳の一年はただ普通に過ごして終わらせるつもりは全くございません！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まさに、「能條革命」を起こしてやろうと試みてます！！！！！！！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うっしゃ❤"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ついてこい！みんな！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ではさっそく..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんに愛を"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2013/10/13/7125712/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"........."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"......"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"フォーユー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2013/10/13/7125712/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いやあーーーーきゃーーー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とても恥ずかしいねこれね。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、届いたかな？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2013/10/13/7125712/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、お洋服はね、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ニット...GROWZE"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スカート...EMODA"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だよん( ´ ▽ ` )ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"EMODAだーいすき❤"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日の服みんな褒めてくれたから嬉しかった！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ウギウギウギ。これね、ずーさんの笑い方の真似なんだよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ウギウギウギ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして！！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちょっと日にちが過ぎちゃったけど、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"代々木第一体育館での初単独ライブ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昼も夜も無事大成功なり。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私ね、初めてライブ中に感動して涙が出たの。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"オープニングでステージが下からうえに上がっていく仕組みでメンバーが出てくるんだけども、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"上がってきた時サイリウムの多さに驚きで涙が出たよね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと、途中で花火とか炎が出てくる演出があったりしたんだけど、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あれにはどうしても慣れなくていちいちビクビクしてました。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最っ高でした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2013/10/13/7125712/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと裏話としては..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あのね、観に行った人はわかると思うけどあのステージって3個くらいあったでしょ！？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本ステージから一番奥のステージに移動したり、花道から登場するときはどこを通ってると思う？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなが楽しんでる間あみ達は、めっちゃ真っ暗闇で人が1人しゃがんで通るので精一杯な程度のステージの真下を移動してたの！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よちよち歩きで。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そうじゃなきゃ通れないのよ、狭すぎて！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そこからあのでっかいステージだから目がおかしくなるよね。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一つ方向を間違えたら全く違うステージについちゃうからメンバーみんな必死に覚えました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いや～、あれは大変だった。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみにあわてんぼうの能條は頭ゴッツンぶつけましたとさ。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1人でめっちゃ痛いって叫んでた。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"想像つくでしょ？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"てへぺろ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"次は日本武道館！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"実に楽しみだ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2013/10/13/7125712/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この視線の先には真洋がいます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"真洋が愛未のためにハッピーバースデーソングを歌ってくれてます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"愛未はそれを真剣に見てます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして最終的にはこんな顔になりました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2013/10/13/7125712/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やばーいこわーい。笑"}],"source":"archive"}